      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1852983306}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Bayani, narating natin ang bahagi ng paglalakbay kung saan mas lalong
            nagiging malinaw ang laban ng tama laban sa mali. Sa mga kabanatang ito,
            nakita natin ang paghihiwalay ni Ibarra sa lumang mundo, ang tahimik
            na sakripisyo ni Elias, at ang muling paggising ng damdamin ng masa.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1852983306}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1852983306}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 209708298}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 63400817}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 984377696}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 984377696}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1852983306}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Sa ika-pito antas ng ating paglalakbay sa Noli Me Tangere, Dito,
            unti-unti nang nagkakaroon ng pagkakaisa at paninindigan ang bayan.at
            katarungan. Makikita rito ang pag-usbong ng damdamin ng paghihiganti,
            ang pagkabigo ng sistema, at ang pagkamulat ng mga mamamayan sa tunay
            na mukha ng lipunan.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 209708298}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 63400817}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 984377696}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1852983306}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: 22fabd68364cb944bb795aa86ed709c0, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Ang pagdating ng Guardia Civil sa bayan ay simbolo ng takot at dominasyon.
            Ipinapakita nito kung paanong ang mga inosente ay napapasailalim sa kapangyarihan
            at pang-aapi
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1852983306}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: d2a6a87f593636542a13baab26606139, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Ang paglayo ni Ibarra ay simbolo ng bagong simula at pagharap sa
            mas malawak na laban. Dala niya ang kanyang mga pangarap at sugat, handang
            ipaglaban ang tama sa kabila ng panganib
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1852983306}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: 203c94e3a00b4094098165be59aae43e, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Si Elias ay tahimik na bayani. Ang kanyang pagkawala sa lawa ay simbolo
            ng kabayanihan at sakripisyo para sa bayan. Ang kanyang alaala ay nagpapaalala
            sa atin na ang tunay na bayani ay hindi laging kilala.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 209708298}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 63400817}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 984377696}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1852983306}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: This is the end of our discussion
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1852983306}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Now you must search for 10 hidden scrolls. Each scroll contains
            trivia from Chapters 37 to 44. Collect them all, and you will unlock
            the quiz to prove what you\u2019ve learned"
      setLocation:
